{"id": "DfEdRLcyjEC", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Saat bhaiyon ki laadli behen Veeravati, aur ek nakli chaand. 🌕\n\nYahi woh katha hai jo Krishna ne Draupadi ko sunaai thi, jab Arjun door tap kar rahe the aur Pandavon par sankat tha. Pehle Karwa Chauth par bhookh pyaas se murjhaati behen ko dekh kar bhaiyon ne peepal ke peeche aag jalaai, aage chalni rakh di, aur bol diye ki chaand nikal aaya. Ek chhote se dhokhe ki keemat kitni badi ho sakti hai, ye Veeravati ne dekha. Aur phir ek saal ki shraddha ne wahi lauta diya jo cheen gaya tha.\n\nAaj chaand dekhne se pehle ye katha zaroor sunna, aur jinke saath dekhoge unhe bhi sunaana. 👇\n\nHappy Karwa Chauth 🪔\n\nSources: Karwa Chauth vrat katha (Veeravati ki katha, Krishna-Draupadi samvaad parampara se). Teen nivaalon wali baat aur chalni ki parampara lok kathaon mein milti hai.\n\n#karwachauth #karwachauthspecial #krishna #draupadi #indianculture", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793258583, "like_count": 3648, "comment_count": 18, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1450327333368326a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.535, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNTmANdXiuCCNTwR_0eqqoXhvGA8Q5uU2KjPMLX2JETL7uyVh90psTRyGvhj4xzRdsNwhIG1mKZydY5Kt6iCQSfQe4SpHer47-QzCE.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoZhnLTFONfQ1wdM_poAMM5kdj9hEjfrDIxXKWxWMXvN1AFEMOKPhF49D4Z04l6ZLd6R9KgeF0ShV3QSbgUn6_W&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=kbUTMmJ_xVIQ7kNvwFLsjpr&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=jYutaPuF7taI8UZ06kANiA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQR0mwvT6dfhGfvdXcah9mMEb9wfAVUH7hSkIZUqFDJZLQ&oe=6AF41C8E", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 